            "answer": "<p>Gold and diamond jewellery should be<br/>handled carefully to preserve their finish and structure. Avoid exposure to<br/>harsh chemicals, cleaning agents, perfumes, chlorine, and abrasive surfaces.</p><p>Minor scratches and signs of wear may<br/>naturally develop over time due to regular use. When not worn, store jewellery<br/>safely in its original YAZ & Co packaging or a soft protective pouch.</p>"
