            "answer": "<p>Diamond jewellery should be stored<br/>separately to avoid scratches, tangling, or damage between pieces. We recommend<br/>using protective boxes, pouches, or compartments and keeping jewellery away<br/>from moisture, heat, direct sunlight, and chemicals.</p><p>When travelling, jewellery should be<br/>securely packed and protected individually. Valuable pieces should remain with<br/>the owner whenever possible.</p>"
